      "text": "The normalization function correctly maps CMake falsey strings, OFF, and unset to a single 'unset' state. This properly handles non-CUDA host build lines (e.g., intel, mini) matching against their actual cache value of OFF without breaking valid mismatches (ON vs OFF or absent vs present arch lists). We verified the tests fail when the normalizer is mutated to identity."
